          "author": "Cleveland Museum of Art",
          "title": "Apollo",
          "publisher": "Cleveland Museum of Art",
          "readAt": "https://openaccess-api.clevelandart.org/api/artworks/144707",
          "accessed": "2026-11-03",
          "tier": 4,
          "license": "CC0"
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "quote",
        "text": "[Goltzius] was perhaps the first adequately to realise the capabilities of the graver in expressing tone and surface qualities.",
